{"channelId":"UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","row":["The College Explorer",963,"Welcome to The College Explorer, your ultimate guide to navigating the world of higher education. Our channel is dedicated to providing in-depth information about colleges and universities, helping students make informed decisions about their academic journeys. From campus tours and application tips to scholarship advice and student life highlights, we cover a wide range of topics that matter to prospective students and their families.\n\nJoin us as we share stories from current students, interview admissions experts, and offer practical tips to enhance your college search experience. Whether you're a high school student planning your future or a parent looking for guidance, our content is designed to support you every step of the way.\n\nDisclaimer: The content on this channel is for informational purposes only and should not be considered as advice. Always conduct your own research and due diligence before making any decisions related to college or university enrollment.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:19.419Z","channelId":"UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"946846d8f3c952d87950b71d69868ae17bfc20fe6df592d73d15602701f9c287","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7d12c0089a87e245d1f611cd5234f6359dad87e8e33cecfb5504e66342e2f158"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:33:47.757Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":963,"raw":"963 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO5JxtJdD0ZClwZFzAMacsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:19.419Z"}],"emails":[]